(17,568,'mode','Mode','default_3x3',1,39,1,7,'1','1','0','0','catalog_mode_headline1','catalog_mode_teaser1','','Steely functionality combined with a sleek designer upholstery. The Habbo who chooses this furniture is a cool urban cat - streetwise, sassy and so slightly untouchable.','','','',0,'','NORMAL'),
