(63,218,'triggers','Triggers','default_3x3',1,81,1,3,'1','1','0','0','catalog_wired_header2_en','ctlg_pic_wired_triggers','','Triggers let you define what needs to happen for an Effect to take place. To program a Trigger, place it in a room, double click on it and set it up! You need to stack an Effect with the Trigger to make it work.',NULL,NULL,'Click to see how each Trigger works.',0,'','NORMAL'),
