(232,277,'pterodactyl','Pterodactyl','single_bundle',1,260,1,4,'1','1','0','0','jurassic15_catalog_header','dino_pets','','These pterrific pets have a fierce appearance with long talons and sharp teeth, but their sweet nature always shines through! Ultra laid-back, these \'flying lizards\' love nothing more than spending time with their owner, soaring through the Hotel skies and eating their favourite food...the humble kale leaf.','','','',0,'','NORMAL'),
